'''Giddean Danu''' was a [[human]] [[Gender|male]] [[senator]]<ref name="VE" /> who represented [[Kuat]]<ref name="End of the Clone Wars">{{EncyclopediaCite|The End of the Clone Wars}}</ref> in the [[Galactic Senate]] of the [[Galactic Republic|Republic]] during the [[Clone Wars]]. Prior to the war's end, he supported the [[Delegation of 2,000]] out of concern over various amendments to the [[Galactic Constitution|constitution]]. As a result, Danu and his allies presented the [[Petition of 2,000]] to [[Supreme Chancellor]] [[Darth Sidious|Sheev Palpatine]]. He wore a traditional overcoat and had [[Color|black]] [[hair]], dark skin and brown [[eye]]s.<ref name="VE" />

{{Char-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Giddean Danu was played by [[Christopher Kirby]] in [[Star Wars: Episode III Revenge of the Sith|''Revenge of the Sith'']].

